This applet embeds a fenced jq-derived JSON query runtime inside bx.

Import layout:
- upstream/src/: copied jq source snapshot plus checked-in generated lexer/parser
- upstream/vendor/decNumber/: jq's imported decimal arithmetic subset

Local policy:
- bx exposes only the `jq` multicall applet entrypoint
- regex builtins are wired to libpcre2 instead of Oniguruma
- bx owns the import config/build seam, version/build metadata, and dispatch wrapper
